    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d522-a1">

                <pb facs="0688" n="568" xml:id="pg568"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">memorandum.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Italian Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Washington, D.
                                C.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-06-21"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June, 1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Do the officers of the immigration admit in the United States:</p>
                <p>An immigrant or a family of immigrants which comes with the intention to settle
                    in a determined place and to buy land there on long payment and without paying
                    any sum on account of price of sale?</p>
                <p>An immigrant or a family of immigrants which comes to work lands on shares; i.
                    e., the net profit derived from the crop raised to be divided between the
                    laborer and the owner?</p>
            </div>
        </body>
